url: "https://github.com/marceloroldao/resolutive-DB/releases/tag/0.2.0-rc1"
abstract: >-
  BDR is an experimental persistent key-value database research project investigating
  deterministic resolutive addressing, local partitioning, adaptive data structures,
  write-ahead logging, checkpoints, crash recovery, stable C ABI integration, Python
  bindings, and reproducible performance evaluation. Version 0.2.0-rc1 is an
  experimental release candidate and is not represented as production-ready. The
  project does not claim strict worst-case O(1) complexity for the complete engine.
